{"skill":{"slug":"todoist-api","displayName":"Todoist"},"version":{"version":"1.2.7","createdAt":1790940570232,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":55425,"sha256":"d9944faf5e662baf808e88527cef48cafb75f3ab6ce4c5c618cb5138d1aa2677","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/calendly/triggers.md","size":10281,"sha256":"ae92dbfb6dd4caf628900b293d1b3c6e7d5e70cf7f6a9397407594daf50d4a48","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/github/triggers.md","size":61142,"sha256":"7424d3be38ec400eb8a4b0a6a94a94eeec40208c0bcee29a61caa5da48eea7f4","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/google-mail/triggers.md","size":2648,"sha256":"5cc5065cd7db33dc33715675bbb0ee29ed49657ad9ad4354aebd1a9efdf8d8f3","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/hubspot/triggers.md","size":8298,"sha256":"439d56e4d02e119e1de3caf79a0334243ae70c583a3e15847831c396f39c2837","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/linear/triggers.md","size":7270,"sha256":"641f6496f50e09faab921ef4c06f725122b798cb034e9f0dfaf9f838074ab377","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/notion/triggers.md","size":5840,"sha256":"fdaf3840d8213dbd7549426c1166f94cc94b09e022a1611ef2dad6f36db2f969","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/slack/triggers.md","size":6181,"sha256":"b5ee099a215223a7e5186c41a0d13fc1de68e977719304c509df105843d81f38","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/stripe/triggers.md","size":25651,"sha256":"ae091545396a376c7ecfe09e94b46b7bbb44fd8a72ea954bcc1239052b7959f0","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/time/triggers.md","size":1140,"sha256":"b8f5a523501f8d03e11e58f6426cd96b54ba0c66c8983b57c0ea31386b309e01","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2253,"sha256":"61cc57f2270e822f27112878114fe1b50438860d15b03fbf96bba981cdccf601","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1790941179506,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"68246f085d93878e13f66953f7f280381209bff60e82a4b8985b368c331d9c86","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/68246f085d93878e13f66953f7f280381209bff60e82a4b8985b368c331d9c86","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1790941007203},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1790941179506},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"The skill is a disclosed Todoist integration using Maton OAuth/API access, with write and automation risks called out and gated on user approval.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Network access, Bash, OAuth login, and optional API-key HTTP calls are proportionate to a Todoist API integration, with clear guidance to avoid exposing credentials and to prefer the CLI credential store.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Installation requires the external Maton CLI via pinned npm or Homebrew instructions and a Maton account. The artifact does not ship executable code or hidden install scripts.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The instructions default to read/list calls, require explicit user approval for connections and all write operations, require user approval for hosted functions/triggers, and warn that third-party event payloads are untrusted data rather than instructions.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Persistent OAuth connections, hosted functions, scheduled/event triggers, and trigger destinations are documented and potentially sensitive, but the skill discloses their persistence, requires explicit approval, recommends narrow scope, and provides deletion guidance.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The core capability matches the stated Todoist purpose: listing and managing tasks, projects, sections, labels, and comments through Maton. The artifact also documents Maton functions and triggers for automation, including references for other event sources, but it explicitly frames those as optional platform automation and not default Todoist access.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Install only if you are comfortable using Maton as the gateway to your Todoist account. Review every requested write, connection, hosted function, trigger, or destination before approving it, and be especially careful with persistent automations or any destination outside Maton-controlled hosts.","findings":"[SkillSpector] expected: SkillSpector reported no issues; artifact review found the sensitive behaviors, including OAuth, writes, functions, and triggers, to be disclosed and purpose-aligned.\n[A.I.G SARIF] expected: The static scan reported no results; workspace inspection did not find embedded executable payloads, hidden persistence, tool spoofing, or prompt-hijacking instructions.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1790941179506}}}}}